Emilli Remote for Android ("Emilli 원격"), branch android-play
==============================================================

This branch is the complete corresponding source of the Android app
"Emilli 원격" (package net.emillis.remote) that LoomNaru Labs Inc builds for
Google Play, version 1.5.0, versionCode 71. It is a modified version of
RustDesk, the open source remote desktop software by Purslane Tech Pte. Ltd.
and the RustDesk contributors (https://github.com/rustdesk/rustdesk).
RustDesk is licensed under the GNU Affero General Public License, version 3
(AGPL-3.0); see the file LICENCE. This modified version is distributed under
the same licence, without any warranty.

Base: RustDesk tag 1.5.0, commit fada664df7a294d1d1a9ca3e7cd3637069122f17,
with libs/hbb_common at commit 229b904508364c8997aad0fb5af57effac859f60
(https://github.com/rustdesk/hbb_common) included as plain files (the
first commit of this branch, shared with main).

Changes, each in its own commit after the base:

1. .github/workflows: upstream's workflows are removed (this branch is
   source only).
2. libs/hbb_common/src/config.rs: the built-in ID server is rd.emillis.net
   and the built-in public key is that server's key.
3. flutter/android/app/build.gradle, AndroidManifest.xml: package
   net.emillis.remote and the app name "Emilli 원격".
4. src/common.rs: when no account (API) server is saved, the app uses
   https://rd.emillis.net; src/flutter_ffi.rs: on Android direct IP access
   ("direct-server") is always off.
5. src/common.rs: the app never asks RustDesk's servers for a new version;
   updates come from Google Play or the administrator.
6. src/lang/en.rs, src/lang/ko.rs: the input permission notice says what the
   Accessibility service does, that it reads the focused text field only to
   type into it, and that nothing it reads is stored or sent.
7. flutter/android/app/src/main/res: Emilli launcher and notification icons
   and the icon background colour; flutter/pubspec.yaml: version 1.5.0+71.
8. build-android/: the build recipe (Docker toolchain, build steps, the same
   changes as patch files, the icon drawing script). NOTICE and
   .github/README.md are new.

The Google Play build is made from upstream tag 1.5.0 plus the patch files in
build-android/patches, which give exactly the tree of this branch outside
build-android/ and this NOTICE. Everything else is unchanged upstream code.

"RustDesk" is the name of the upstream project. This build is not made,
endorsed or supported by the RustDesk developers. For the official RustDesk
apps, use https://rustdesk.com or https://github.com/rustdesk/rustdesk.
